WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.712
A useful report combines numerical summaries with a sentence a reader can understand.

00:00:05.712 --> 00:00:12.742
The code calculates mean, median, minimum, maximum, and overall spread.

00:00:12.742 --> 00:00:17.043
Then f-strings turn those results into two short statements.

00:00:17.631 --> 00:00:19.563
This is a good reporting habit.

00:00:19.563 --> 00:00:26.698
Do not dump raw statistical output when a concise interpretation can communicate the result more clearly.

00:00:26.698 --> 00:00:31.098
Always keep the wording tied to what the statistic actually supports.
